@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Committee Assignment

DEVELOPER OWNER: UNASSIGNED — Team assignment required
MODULE: Committees (tender-specific membership)
TRELLO TASK: None — no dedicated Trello card
TRELLO URL: —

PURPOSE:
Assign the tender-specific Evaluation Committee (Sourcing
Manager, Department, Financial and Technical
representatives) and the separate four-member Top Committee.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Business role NOT yet decided (Sourcing Officer or Admin) —
placed in the Sourcing Officer area until the team decides.

ROUTE: /SourcingOfficer/Tenders/Committees/{id?}

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- Decide who assigns committees (Sourcing Officer or Admin)
  and move/authorize the page accordingly.
- Store the Evaluation seat in
  CommitteeMember.Responsibility (SourcingManager,
  DepartmentRepresentative, FinancialRepresentative,
  TechnicalRepresentative; null for Top). The filtered
  unique index already allows each seat once per tender.
- Validate exactly 4 per committee, the 4 Evaluation
  responsibilities, and no overlap; freeze membership once a
  committee round has votes.

DEPENDENCIES:
CommitteeMembers, AspNetUsers, AspNetUserRoles,
CommitteeRounds.

STATUS:
UI SCAFFOLD ONLY — BUSINESS LOGIC NOT IMPLEMENTED.

IMPORTANT:
Required by the workflow (votes and scores need assigned
members) but no Trello card or business role is defined —
team decision required.
===========================================================
*@
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Committee Assignment";
    ViewData["WorkspaceSection"] = "Tenders";
    ViewData["Description"] = "The four Evaluation Committee members and the four separate Top Committee members of this tender.";
}
<partial name="_PageHeader" />
<partial name="_ScaffoldNotice" />

<aside class="pg-note"><strong>Composition rules</strong><p>Evaluation Committee: exactly 4 — Sourcing Manager, Requesting Department Representative, Financial Representative, Technical Representative. Top Committee: exactly 4 other people. The same person cannot sit on both committees of one tender (enforced by the unique index on CommitteeMembers TenderId + UserId).</p></aside>

<div class="pg-grid">
<section class="ws-panel pg-panel" aria-labelledby="tbl-evaluation-committee">
    <div class="pg-panel-head"><h2 id="tbl-evaluation-committee">Evaluation Committee</h2></div>
    <div class="pg-table-wrap">
        <table class="pg-table">
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Responsibility</th><th scope="col">Member</th><th scope="col">Assigned</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td colspan="3"><partial name="_EmptyState" model='"No members assigned."' /></td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>
<section class="ws-panel pg-panel" aria-labelledby="tbl-top-committee">
    <div class="pg-panel-head"><h2 id="tbl-top-committee">Top Committee</h2></div>
    <div class="pg-table-wrap">
        <table class="pg-table">
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Seat</th><th scope="col">Member</th><th scope="col">Assigned</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td colspan="3"><partial name="_EmptyState" model='"No members assigned."' /></td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>
</div>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel">
    <h2>Assign member</h2>
    <form class="pg-form">
        <fieldset disabled>
            <div class="pg-form-grid">
                <div class="pg-field"><label for="f-committee-1">Committee</label><select id="f-committee-1"><option>Evaluation</option><option>Top</option></select></div>
                <div class="pg-field"><label for="f-responsibility-2">Responsibility</label><select id="f-responsibility-2"><option>Sourcing Manager</option><option>Department Representative</option><option>Financial Representative</option><option>Technical Representative</option><option>Top Committee member</option></select></div>
                <div class="pg-field"><label for="f-user-3">User</label><select id="f-user-3"><option>Select a user with the matching role</option></select></div>
            </div>
            <div class="pg-actions"><button type="submit" class="pg-btn pg-btn-primary">Assign member</button><span class="pg-hint">Not implemented yet — nothing is saved.</span></div>
        </fieldset>
    </form>
</section>

<nav class="pg-links" aria-label="Related pages">
    <ul>
        <li><a asp-area="SourcingOfficer" asp-controller="Tenders" asp-action="Details">Tender details</a></li>
    </ul>
</nav>
